# v1.5.1 (S15.1): ink drawn in preview (1-bit, Paper and Night); .ink/ follows rename and move.
copy-notes tests/test-notes/_test
tap-on Write
tap-on Draw
press-on InkArea
move 500 1500
move 700 1400
move 900 1560
move 1100 1420
release
wait 700
tap-on Insert
tap-on Preview
shot v1.5.1-preview-ink-paper
tap-on Pencil
tap-on Options
tap-on Display
tap-on Dark mode/On
tap-on Close
tap-on Preview
shot v1.5.1-preview-ink-night
tap-on Pencil
tap-on Options
tap-on Display
tap-on Dark mode/Off
tap-on Close
tap-on Title
clear-field
type ink-walk
tap-on OK
expect-open _test/ink-walk.md
expect-file _test/.ink/ink-walk/ink-001.svg
expect-file _test/.ink/ink-walk/ink-001.strokes.json
expect-no-file _test/.ink/test-00-start-here
expect ](.ink/ink-walk/ink-001.svg)
expect-file-contains _test/ink-walk.md|](.ink/ink-walk/ink-001.svg)
shot v1.5.1-after-rename
tap-on Files
tap-on More:ink-walk.md
tap-on Move
tap-on _test / folders
expect-open _test/folders/ink-walk.md
expect-file _test/folders/.ink/ink-walk/ink-001.svg
expect-no-file _test/.ink
tap-on Close
tap-on Preview
shot v1.5.1-preview-after-move
tap-on Pencil
